6BmmO5X6CNwQ7kNvwEBsS94&_nc_oc=AdqtlzHlpNwigOeEX67decbNLNfvgoEjP8cdaTV3kxqrtzFktZTTFrX4K-vKvkwair4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPRQNAYKPQcIhqHlapE3hGsV9AUuesD75f_Rm58yls78g&oe=6AE354B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DPzkWxFwO3kQ7kNvwEOXpi6&_nc_oc=Adq623rGX43qSgoCZv83EMFkvyhlgCcdk9Yok9QmTOkgGasaD0MKKi2TaGUwUjPuqm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMU0Xnb3p3fY0nv3CuGJY0ZwSJuCc_HljnwxD7vHdLodA&oe=6AE3564A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gy2eB4u5WVkQ7kNvwHHFqhr&_nc_oc=AdrhSjTWhTfdSxSyugtYo6oQIPSr__hK8t2CpXC2Qo-yudBoAHS8pBetgngUjLV4kX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNF8Z_BFaEIkzEKQF7yD03j9O6NuGN5Zq-0HIBJrPfnbQ&oe=6AE3436F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8x15NRDGEx0Q7kNvwFNzd4v&_nc_oc=Adrk8TwK7DDnggZbcrjd_rbFn2DXzAFR660HDL_d4mhf-PL4xYQnah5OCJ3SWiyWRCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNDztzyYYKtZpFi_9nvYhNdABrR9W54ncI6-Mhrh7EEOA&oe=6AE36503"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YRyuJJE6KqAQ7kNvwE4xEnR&_nc_oc=Adq0uKCvlzk_N5_-et_r4LmGhjdhxI4jYkKmPXU1wwM9-u3mwlSef_u2xBm38nTLirE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPylWMmLVXtfkjSI1mMl7AkxJdK3o2inCe1Hs__0sACnw&oe=6AE35D58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tA1Aw3qA_ZEQ7kNvwFMz0qA&_nc_oc=AdpYNLgen2LWP0cCVTvUBH29RWMoF7KlxOj1Eo4wg3kgEL4DuTI_j_96GTNONiNEEqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNG0kG7UHfx9EXBBiLW0kw5ybvAJ4IEwqYAv-l3fFTpIw&oe=6AE3383C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080